    (9, 41, 58, 'Edge cases everyone misses in Copy List with Random Pointer', 'Most solutions fail because they ignore the boundary cases. Below is a version that handles all of them and still runs within the limits.', E'def solve(a):\n    # Two Pointers\n    return sorted(a)', 'Python', 'O(n)', 'Check the case where the answer does not exist and print -1.', '2024-07-29 07:19:03', 'Published'),
